#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:30002
#: 0739cd3df98d43d79290f2710c2da025
msgid "1. Synthetic Data"
msgstr "1\\. 合成データの準備"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:30004
#: 71e87397f37d4cb9a3cc2c5f0c81cfe9
msgid "We build a 2-minute strain time series containing:"
msgstr "以下を含む 2 分間の strain 時系列を生成します："

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:30006
#: 273ec118bd0b4673a07273590a6f00da
msgid ""
"**Stationary Gaussian noise** with a slowly drifting amplitude (non-"
"stationarity)"
msgstr "**定常ガウスノイズ**（ゆっくり変化する振幅 → 非定常）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:30007
#: 682bee14651a4bc8873629eeac23093e
msgid "**Persistent narrowband line** at 60 Hz (power-line coupling)"
msgstr "**60 Hz 持続ライン**（電源ハム）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:30008
#: 010797630d8046e695797c85749f6940
msgid "**Transient glitches** at 15 s, 45 s, and 90 s"
msgstr "**過渡グリッチ**（15 s, 45 s, 90 s）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:50002
#: d5db621bbceb4b5d940c31cd06262435
msgid "2. Baseline Spectrogram"
msgstr "2\\. ベースライン スペクトログラム"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:50004
#: adccea27ba7546f491b28f3e6271d74a
msgid ""
"The raw spectrogram already shows glitches (bright vertical stripes), the 60"
" Hz line (bright horizontal stripe), and the time-varying noise floor."
msgstr "生スペクトログラムには、グリッチ（明るい縦縞）、60 Hz ライン（明るい横縞）、 時間変動するノイズフロアがすでに見えています。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:70002
#: 5fef28b72ab845a69d89a11dc035924d
msgid "3. Normalization"
msgstr "3\\. 正規化"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:70004
#: ced44aecc6f14a848fb1ac06f803be87
msgid "3a. SNR Spectrogram (`method='snr'`)"
msgstr "3a. SNR スペクトログラム (`method='snr'`)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:70006
#: a7b3b1b60be848419536c101b760e900
msgid ""
"The most common normalization for transient searches: divide each time slice"
" by the **median PSD** along the time axis.   Result is a dimensionless "
"**SNR²** map where the stationary background ≈ 1."
msgstr ""
"トランジェント探索で最も一般的な正規化です。各時間スライスを、時間軸に沿った **中央値 PSD** で割ります。結果は無次元の **SNR²** "
"マップとなり、定常背景は ≈ 1 になります。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:90002
#: 19608fb43c6e4015a2f14fa4ca37c1c9
msgid "3b. Other Normalization Methods"
msgstr "3b. その他の正規化メソッド"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: a67183c20d444eeaa4d0559fc5b94d7b
msgid "`method=`"
msgstr "`method=`"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: 15d853722254481f8a42a1c702520b27
msgid "Denominator"
msgstr "分母"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: 484a4eeec97042419d135b13f15bcc51
msgid "`'median'`"
msgstr "`'median'`"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: bba4760177964105829f9d8a99eb072d
msgid "Median PSD per frequency bin (identical to `'snr'`)"
msgstr "周波数ビン毎の中央値 PSD（`'snr'` と同一）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: 072a10e670b04a1a9c5f6345d280d0b6
msgid "`'mean'`"
msgstr "`'mean'`"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: 4e36b7f539624a7888a560184047e578
msgid "Mean PSD per frequency bin"
msgstr "周波数ビン毎の平均 PSD"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: b737836c8af948f8bb2d7e023f38b287
msgid "`'percentile'`"
msgstr "`'percentile'`"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb
#: 4d150e163883489b8415131e514e3de8
msgid "Nth-percentile PSD (controlled by `percentile=`)"
msgstr "第 N パーセンタイル PSD（`percentile=` で指定）"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:110002
#: 7a8b213ec6ee4cdf85b00f37ae032877
msgid "3c. Reference Normalization (`method='reference'`)"
msgstr "3c. 参照スペクトル正規化 (`method='reference'`)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:110004
#: 986812e4ddf64e689ddd3beb29729952
msgid ""
"Supply your own reference spectrum — useful when you want to compare against"
" a specific quiet period or an independently measured noise floor."
msgstr "独自の参照スペクトルを渡して正規化します。 特定の静粛期間や独立計測したノイズフロアとの比較に有用です。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:130002
#: d0f9788854d34640b0d6fc27ba831e5b
msgid "4. Cleaning"
msgstr "4\\. クリーニング"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:130004
#: d5c4fb2867a942d3b8b975c74434eb7d
msgid "4a. Threshold Cleaning (`method='threshold'`)"
msgstr "4a. 閾値クリーニング (`method='threshold'`)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:130006
#: 48c43762b550416d96462de435256a32
msgid ""
"Pixels that exceed `median + threshold × MAD` (per frequency bin) are "
"flagged as outliers and replaced.  Replacement strategy is controlled by "
"`fill=` (`'median'`, `'nan'`, `'zero'`, or `'interpolate'`)."
msgstr ""
"（周波数ビンごとに）`median + threshold × MAD` を超えるピクセルを外れ値として検出し、置換します。置換方法は "
"`fill=`（`'median'`、`'nan'`、`'zero'`、`'interpolate'`）で制御します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:130010
#: 1796073847954a00a58a76d0bf7f9924
msgid ""
"This removes short-duration **glitches** that appear as bright vertical "
"streaks."
msgstr "これにより、明るい縦縞として現れる短時間の **グリッチ** を除去します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:150002
#: 5f8078933ac341c19677b138b0e77652
msgid "4b. Rolling-Median Detrending (`method='rolling_median'`)"
msgstr "4b. ローリング中央値デトレンド (`method='rolling_median'`)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:150004
#: b3a6f1257d624ad6bc236bfd19af4b6e
msgid ""
"Divide each column by a running median along the time axis.   This removes "
"**slow non-stationary trends** without distorting short-duration features."
msgstr "各列を時間軸方向の移動中央値で割ります。これにより、短時間の特徴を歪めることなく **ゆっくりとした非定常トレンド** を除去します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:170002
#: 36e19580c9ac45a4a80ef8a817fc6ab4
msgid "4c. Persistent Line Removal (`method='line_removal'`)"
msgstr "4c. 持続ライン除去 (`method='line_removal'`)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:170004
#: 2d30120a00694580b7a44dd824a5a1ab
msgid ""
"A frequency bin is flagged as a persistent line if it exceeds "
"`amplitude_threshold × global_median` for more than `persistence_threshold` "
"fraction of time bins.   Detected bins are replaced with their time-median."
msgstr ""
"ある周波数ビンが、時間ビンの `persistence_threshold` を超える割合で `amplitude_threshold × "
"global_median` を上回る場合、定常的なラインとして検出されます。検出されたビンは時間中央値で置換されます。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:190002
#: 44173b08c9c94d6a9cb0124d52a38f81
msgid "4d. Full Cleaning Pipeline (`method='combined'`)"
msgstr "4d. 完全クリーニングパイプライン (`method='combined'`)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:190004
#: 5fe9c56104af47e7a58cd35e4b15774f
msgid ""
"Runs threshold → rolling-median → line-removal in sequence.   Recommended as"
" a one-stop solution for commissioning-style data quality checks."
msgstr "しきい値処理 → 移動中央値 → ライン除去 を順に実行します。コミッショニング的なデータ品質チェックのワンストップ手段として推奨します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:210002
#: ea30f2f523354ada949c41562dabd3d5
msgid "5. Summary"
msgstr "5\\. まとめ"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_spectrogram_processing.ipynb:210004
